    proxies:
      - '🇺🇸 US | 🟢 | vless | @NamiraConfigs | 55'
      - '🇺🇸 US | 🟢 | vless | @NamiraConfigs | 57'
      - '🇩🇪 DE | 🔴 | vless | @NamiraConfigs | 58'

